# This repo is authored on Windows and runs on Linux. Git's default CRLF
# translation would put \r at the end of every shebang line and turn
# infra/*.sh into "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env: No such file or directory".
# Force LF everywhere; there is nothing Windows-native in here.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh       text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml      text eol=lf
*.yaml     text eol=lf
*.py       text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pem binary
